cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "WiFI-BC: Wire-Fitting Implicit Behavioral Cloning"
message: "If you use this software, please cite the accompanying paper."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Anonymous (paper under double-blind review)"
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of Wire-Fitting Implicit Behavioral Cloning
  (WiFI-BC), an implicit imitation-learning policy that scores a small learned
  set of candidate actions rather than optimizing over the full action space,
  together with the IBC, Diffusion Policy, Consistency Policy and explicit BC
  baselines it is compared against.
